[{"answer":"Hello, Junior Cycle camp, Jake speaking.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-1-2023-01-02-23-49-11/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Hi.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-1-2023-01-02-23-49-11/2.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm calling for some information about the cycle camp -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-1-2023-01-02-23-49-11/3.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm thinking of sending my son.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-1-2023-01-02-23-49-11/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Great.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-1-2023-01-02-23-49-11/5.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, it's held every weekday morning over the summer vacation","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-1-2023-01-02-23-49-11/6.mp3"},{"answer":"and we focus on basic cycling skills and safety.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-1-2023-01-02-23-49-11/7.mp3"},{"answer":"We have eight levels for children from three years upwards.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-1-2023-01-02-23-49-11/8.mp3"},{"answer":"How old's your son?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-1-2023-01-02-23-49-11/9.mp3"},{"answer":"Charlie? He's seven.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-1-2023-01-02-23-49-11/10.mp3"},{"answer":"He can ride a bike,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-1-2023-01-02-23-49-11/11.mp3"},{"answer":"but he needs a little more training before he's safe to go on the road.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-1-2023-01-02-23-49-11/12.mp3"},{"answer":"He'd probably be best in Level 5.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-1-2023-01-02-23-49-11/13.mp3"},{"answer":"They start off practising on the site here,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-1-2023-01-02-23-49-11/14.mp3"},{"answer":"and we aim to get them riding on the road,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-1-2023-01-02-23-49-11/15.mp3"},{"answer":"but first they're taken to ride in the park, away from the traffic.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-1-2023-01-02-23-49-11/16.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-1-2023-01-02-23-49-11/17.mp3"},{"answer":"And can you tell me a bit about the instructors?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-1-2023-01-02-23-49-11/18.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, all our staff wear different coloured shirts.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-1-2023-01-02-23-49-11/19.mp3"},{"answer":"So, we have three supervisors, and they have red shirts.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-1-2023-01-02-23-49-11/20.mp3"},{"answer":"They support the instructors,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-1-2023-01-02-23-49-11/21.mp3"},{"answer":"and they also stand in for me if I'm not around.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-1-2023-01-02-23-49-11/22.mp3"},{"answer":"Then the instructors themselves are in blue shirts,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-1-2023-01-02-23-49-11/23.mp3"},{"answer":"and one of these is responsible for each class.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-1-2023-01-02-23-49-11/24.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-1-2023-01-02-23-49-11/25.mp3"},{"answer":"In order to be accepted,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-1-2023-01-02-23-49-11/26.mp3"},{"answer":"all our instructors have to submit a reference from someone who's seen them work with children -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-1-2023-01-02-23-49-11/27.mp3"},{"answer":"like if they've worked as a babysitter, for example.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-1-2023-01-02-23-49-11/28.mp3"},{"answer":"Then they have to complete our training course,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-1-2023-01-02-23-49-11/29.mp3"},{"answer":"including how to do lesson plans,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-1-2023-01-02-23-49-11/30.mp3"},{"answer":"and generally care for the well-being of the kids in their class.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-1-2023-01-02-23-49-11/31.mp3"},{"answer":"They do a great job, I have to say.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-1-2023-01-02-23-49-11/32.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-1-2023-01-02-23-49-11/33.mp3"},{"answer":"And tell me a bit about the classes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-1-2023-01-02-23-49-11/34.mp3"},{"answer":"What size will Charlie's class be?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-1-2023-01-02-23-49-11/35.mp3"},{"answer":"We have a limit of eight children in each class,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-1-2023-01-02-23-49-11/36.mp3"},{"answer":"so their instructor really gets to know them well.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-1-2023-01-02-23-49-11/37.mp3"},{"answer":"They're out riding most of the time","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-1-2023-01-02-23-49-11/38.mp3"},{"answer":"but they have quiet times too,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-1-2023-01-02-23-49-11/39.mp3"},{"answer":"where their instructor might tell them a story that's got something to do with cycling,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-1-2023-01-02-23-49-11/40.mp3"},{"answer":"or get them to play a game together.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-1-2023-01-02-23-49-11/41.mp3"},{"answer":"It's a lot of fun.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-1-2023-01-02-23-49-11/42.mp3"},{"answer":"It must be.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-1-2023-01-02-23-49-11/43.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, what happens if there's rain?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-1-2023-01-02-23-49-11/44.mp3"},{"answer":"Do the classes still run?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-1-2023-01-02-23-49-11/45.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-1-2023-01-02-23-49-11/46.mp3"},{"answer":"We don't let that put us off -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-1-2023-01-02-23-49-11/47.mp3"},{"answer":"we just put on our waterproofs and keep cycling.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-1-2023-01-02-23-49-11/48.mp3"},{"answer":"And is there anything special Charlie should bring along with him?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-1-2023-01-02-23-49-11/49.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, maybe some spare clothes,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-1-2023-01-02-23-49-11/50.mp3"},{"answer":"especially if the weather's not so good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-1-2023-01-02-23-49-11/51.mp3"},{"answer":"And a snack for break time.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-1-2023-01-02-23-49-11/52.mp3"},{"answer":"How about a drink?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-1-2023-01-02-23-49-11/53.mp3"},{"answer":"No, we'll provide that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-1-2023-01-02-23-49-11/54.mp3"},{"answer":"And make sure he has shoes, not sandals.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-1-2023-01-02-23-49-11/55.mp3"},{"answer":"Sure.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-1-2023-01-02-23-49-11/56.mp3"},{"answer":"And just at present Charlie has to take medication every few hours,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-1-2023-01-02-23-49-11/57.mp3"},{"answer":"so I'll make sure he has that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-1-2023-01-02-23-49-11/58.mp3"},{"answer":"Absolutely.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-1-2023-01-02-23-49-11/59.mp3"},{"answer":"Just give us details of when he has to take it","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-1-2023-01-02-23-49-11/60.mp3"},{"answer":"and we'll make sure he does.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-1-2023-01-02-23-49-11/61.mp3"},{"answer":"Thanks.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-1-2023-01-02-23-49-11/62.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, there are a few things you should know about Day 1 of the camp.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-1-2023-01-02-23-49-11/63.mp3"},{"answer":"The classes normally start at 9:30 every morning,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-1-2023-01-02-23-49-11/64.mp3"},{"answer":"but on Day 1, you should aim to get Charlie here by 9:20.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-1-2023-01-02-23-49-11/65.mp3"},{"answer":"The finishing time will be 12:30 as usual.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-1-2023-01-02-23-49-11/66.mp3"},{"answer":"We need the additional time because there are a few extra things to do.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-1-2023-01-02-23-49-11/67.mp3"},{"answer":"The most important is that we have a very careful check to make sure that every child's helmet fits properly.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-1-2023-01-02-23-49-11/68.mp3"},{"answer":"If it doesn't fit, we'll try to adjust it,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-1-2023-01-02-23-49-11/69.mp3"},{"answer":"or we'll find him another one -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-1-2023-01-02-23-49-11/70.mp3"},{"answer":"but he must wear it all the time he's on the bike.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-1-2023-01-02-23-49-11/71.mp3"},{"answer":"Of course.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-1-2023-01-02-23-49-11/72.mp3"},{"answer":"Then after that, all the instructors will be waiting to meet their classes,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-1-2023-01-02-23-49-11/73.mp3"},{"answer":"and they'll meet up in the tent -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-1-2023-01-02-23-49-11/74.mp3"},{"answer":"you can't miss it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-1-2023-01-02-23-49-11/75.mp3"},{"answer":"And each instructor will take their class away and get started.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-1-2023-01-02-23-49-11/76.mp3"},{"answer":"OK. Well that all sounds good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-1-2023-01-02-23-49-11/77.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, can you tell me how much the camp costs a week?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-1-2023-01-02-23-49-11/78.mp3"},{"answer":"$199.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-1-2023-01-02-23-49-11/79.mp3"},{"answer":"We've managed to keep the price more or less the same as last year -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-1-2023-01-02-23-49-11/80.mp3"},{"answer":"it was 190 then.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-1-2023-01-02-23-49-11/81.mp3"},{"answer":"But the places are filling up quite quickly.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-1-2023-01-02-23-49-11/82.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-1-2023-01-02-23-49-11/83.mp3"},{"answer":"OK, well I'd like to book for...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-3-part-1-2023-01-02-23-49-11/84.mp3"}]
